    "content": "It wasn’t your everyday lunchtime ping-pong match at Nike’s PHK Campus last week.\n\nInstead, this friendly matchup featured rising tennis star Alex Eala, who faced off against one lucky teammate after gathering with employees in the Dan Fouts Hub for a Q&A about her journey in the sport.\n\n“One of the most rewarding parts of working at Nike is the opportunity to experience moments like these,” says Jujy B. Bonacorsi, APLA Senior Buyer, Sport NSO & NSP. “Playing alongside world‑class athletes and experiencing their drive firsthand — while managing to put up a few points — reinforces how special it is to work at a place where sport, passion and inspiration are truly part of the culture.”\n\nWant another behind-the-scenes look at a Nike tennis athlete? Read about Jannik Sinner’s custom Nike Atelier look in Milan: https://lnkd.in/gi9yQ3QT\n\n#NikeTennis #SwooshLife #JustDoIt",
